<NPR>Choose the bracketed phrases required in the project scope.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Prior to scheduling Commissioning Tests for each system, the Quality Control Manager must issue a Certificate of Readiness for each system, certifying 
that inspections have been completed, open issues have been resolved, and the system is ready for Commissioning Tests.  Refer to each related technical 
commissioning specification section for additional requirements.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Submit the Certificate of Readiness for each system <TAI OPT="ARMY">[30] [_____] calendar days </TAI><TAI OPT="NAVY">[20] [_____] working days </TAI>prior to Commissioning Tests of that system.  
Do not schedule Commissioning Tests for a system until the Certificate of Readiness is approved by the Government.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</PRT><PRT><TTL>PART 2   PRODUCTS</TTL><BRK/>
