<BRK/>
<TXT><TAI OPT="KTR HIRED COMMISSIONING PROVIDER">Conduct a design commissioning coordination meeting led by the CxC prior to the [35] [50] percent design submittal for systems to be commissioned.  
Discuss </TAI><TAI OPT="NAVY"><TAI OPT="GOVT HIRED COMMISSIONING PROVIDER">Participate in a design commissioning coordination meeting led by the CxC prior to the [35] [50] percent design submittal for system to 
be commissioned.  The purpose of the meeting is to discuss </TAI></TAI>the commissioning process, including project contract requirements, lines of communication, 
roles and responsibilities, schedules, and documentation requirements.</TXT><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
