<NPR>NOTE:  This paragraph contains tailoring options for ARMY and NAVY.  For Air Force managed projects, either ARMY 
or NAVY tailoring options may be applied.  Choose bracketed option for command and maintenance activity representatives 
as applicable.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>The <TAI OPT="NAVY">Construction Manager, </TAI><TAI OPT="ARMY">Contractor's Project Manager, </TAI>Quality Control team, Designer of Record, and the Government<TAI OPT="NAVY"> Acceptance Testing Representatives 
and other Government team members</TAI> must attend this meeting.  Invite the User and<TAI OPT="ARMY">[ a Directorate of Public Works Representative][ a Reserve Support 
Command Representative] [_____]</TAI><TAI OPT="NAVY">[ a Public Works Division Representative]</TAI> [Base Civil Engineering Representative] [_____] to attend this meeting.  
The meeting may be conducted by teleconferencing.</TXT><BRK/>
